ing $y$ and $z$ fixed. Apply the sum rule. In each term, differentiate only the factors that depend on $x$; all remaining factors stay fixed.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x}&=\\left(3 y + 3 z\\right)\\cos x+2 \\cos{\\left(y \\right)}\\cdot 1\\\\&=\\left(3 y + 3 z\\right) \\cos{\\left(x \\right)} + 2 \\cos{\\left(y \\right)}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698832 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1b5274f9-9637-5372-819e-24c7c7ba2050" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left(- 3 x - 3 z\\right) \\cos{\\left(y \\right)} - 4 \\cos{\\left(z \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698819} {:answer/id #uuid "248b956f-1d7e-58bd-afe2-2e3b452a2731" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left(x + z\\right) \\cos{\\left(y \\right)} + 2 \\cos{\\left(z \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698820} {:answer/id #uuid "634d9271-2a8e-5df5-9bbf-590dc2668414" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left(- 2 x - 2 y\\right) \\cos{\\left(z \\right)} + \\left(x + z\\right) \\cos{\\left(y \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698830} {:answer/id #uuid "6aae1a9f-a244-5a23-ab10-cb47f172a5a6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left(- 3 x - 3 z\\right) \\cos{\\left(y \\right)} - 2 \\cos{\\left(z \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698833} {:answer/id #uuid "81bdc97d-0fc7-5a07-b046-71c74e36228a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- \\left(- 3 x - 3 z\\right) \\cos{\\left(y \\right)} + 2 \\cos{\\left(z \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698836}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6aae1a9f-a244-5a23-ab10-cb47f172a5a6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left(- 3 x - 3 z\\right) \\cos{\\left(y \\right)} - 2 \\c